{"type": "message", "id": "m6515d363", "parentId": "mb9df2027", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T04:22:15Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A RESTful API is a set of conventions for building web services that use standard HTTP methods to access and manipulate resources as URLs, typically returning data in formats like JSON while being stateless and cacheable."}], "stopReason": "stop", "usage": null}}
{"type": "message", "id": "m7f928562", "parentId": "m6515d363", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T04:22:15Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "写一首关于夏天的四行短诗。"}]}}
{"type": "message", "id": "m2014013e", "parentId": "m7f928562", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T04:22:40Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**RESTful API 一句话解释：**  \n它是一种基于 HTTP 协议、使用标准方法（如 GET、POST、PUT、DELETE）对 URL 标识的资源进行操作、通常以 JSON 格式交换数据的架构风格。\n\n**关于夏天的四行诗：**\n夏日炎炎映碧空，  \n轻风拂面送清凉。  \n蝉鸣声声绿树间，  \n一夜微凉待月明。"}], "stopReason": "stop", "usage": null}}
